Third-party components distributed with reclipz binaries:

  yt-dlp (embedded payload)      Unlicense        https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
  ffmpeg / ffprobe (payload)     LGPL-2.1-or-later (built without --enable-gpl)
  LAME (linked into ffmpeg)      LGPL-2.0-or-later
  ReClip UI (assets/index.html)  MIT              https://github.com/averygan/reclip

See docs/PLAN.md §9.4. Because yt-dlp and ffmpeg are shipped as separate executables (not
linked), the ffmpeg LGPL relinking obligation is satisfied by distributing the unmodified
binary together with its licence and the build script (tools/make_ffmpeg.sh).
